\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Dual-source mixed-flow cluster tool. The LP bank is centred below the vertically aligned ATR and VTR. The dual-hand ATR performs LP pickup, aligner place--then--pick handling, and product return; the VTR has four hands, and the fork grippers of both robots face the chamber-access direction. Solid, dash-dot, dashed, and dotted arrows denote product outbound, product return, dummy outbound, and dummy return routes. Storage--VTR, VTR--rotary-chamber, and ATR--LP links all show separate outbound and return paths. The tool may contain multiple rotary chambers; two four-space chambers are illustrated.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
